== About me
I am a third-year PhD student in Computation, Cognition and Language at [https://ltl.mmll.cam.ac.uk/ Language Technology Lab] in the University of Cambridge, supervised by [https://sites.google.com/site/ivanvulic/ Dr. Ivan Vulić], [https://sites.google.com/site/annakorhonen/ Prof. Anna Korhonen] and [https://sergebelongie.github.io/ Prof. Serge Belongie].
My research is supported by Cambridge Trust.
I am a member of [https://www.jesus.cam.ac.uk/ Jesus College].

Before starting my PhD, I received my MPhil degree in Advanced Computer Science at the Department of Computer Science, supervised by [https://www.cl.cam.ac.uk/~sht25/ Prof. Simone Teufel], supported by Cambridge Trust.
I was an undergraduate student in Automation at [http://en.xjtu.edu.cn/ Xi'an Jiaotong University].


== Research
My research interests center around *Visual Intelligence* with a specific focus on spatial reasoning \[[https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.15037 New Recipes]\], covering Multimodal LLMs, Video Generation Model and Multimodal Agents. 

Specifically, my work focuses on:
- Visual Intelligence and Multimodal Reasoning: \[[https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.11409 Visual Planning, ICLR Oral]\] \[[https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.07542v1 MVoT, ICML]\]
- (M)LLMs and Agents: \[[https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.05966 UnifiedSKG, EMNLP Oral]\] \[[https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.02875 BINDER, ICLR Spotlight]\]
- Video Generation for Planning: \[[https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.21037 Thinking in Frames]\]
- Evaluation and Predictability: \[[https://topviewrs.github.io/ TopViewRS, EMNLP Oral]\] \[[https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.20068 11Plus]\] \[[https://vibe-benchmark.github.io/ VIBE]\]

I'm also interested in the potential downstream application scenarios of multimodal reasoning.

